Both forms above capture the bindings live where they were written, by value and
not by reference: a literal defined inside a function sees that function's
locals, never the caller's.

### Closures

```redblue
to make_counter(start)
    set count to start
    give back to
        give back count
        add 1 to count
    end
end
```

